{"version":1,"_note":"信息源页海报专用(tools/banner/dyn_dev.py),组件不用。关注列表第一个频道的 RSS(免 key)。","actions":[{"op":"set","props":{"key":"tzNow","value":"${@time.nowMs}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"tzLf","value":"$[formatDate::(${tzNow},yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm)]"},"_note":"此刻的**本机**年月日时分。pattern 只用纯 token + `-` `:` 空格(跨端安全子集,G4c)。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"tzY","value":"$[subString::(${tzLf},0,4)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"tzMo","value":"$[subString::(${tzLf},5,7)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"tzD","value":"$[subString::(${tzLf},8,10)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"tzH","value":"$[subString::(${tzLf},11,13)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"tzMi","value":"$[subString::(${tzLf},14,16)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"tzAdj","value":"$[if::(le::(${tzMo},2),1,0)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"tzYoe","value":"$[calc::(${tzY}-2000-${tzAdj})]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"tzMp","value":"$[calc::(${tzMo}-3+12*${tzAdj})]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"tzDb","value":"$[floor::(calc::((153*${tzMp}+2)/5))]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"tzQ4","value":"$[floor::(calc::(${tzYoe}/4))]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"tzDays","value":"$[calc::(11017+${tzYoe}*365+${tzQ4}+${tzDb}+${tzD}-1)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"tzE","value":"$[calc::(${tzDays}*86400000+${tzH}*3600000+${tzMi}*60000)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"tzMin","value":"$[calc::(floor::(calc::(${tzNow}/60000))*60000)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"tzO","value":"$[round::(calc::(${tzE}-${tzMin}))]"},"_note":"本机时区偏移(毫秒):东八区 = 28800000。round 是为了 Android 上 calc 返回 double 时不带 .0。"},{"id":"chans","action":"data.get","params":{"key":"tw_chans","default":[]},"_note":"关注的频道 [{id, name}]。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_b0","value":"1"},"_note":"⚠️ 读取屏障(勿删):data.get 之后紧邻的节点读不到它的结果。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"dflt","value":"$[if::(gt::(length::(${chans}),0),0,1)]"},"_note":"关注列表为空 → 用默认关注取真实数据,海报标「热门」(2026-10-08 改判,原为退回静态图)。"},{"op":"if","props":{"val":"${dflt}"},"items":[{"op":"set","props":{"key":"chans","value":[{"id":"UCBJycsmd